{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640080","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:0:1064008001:0":{"text":"시간과 노력을 들인 끝에, 우리는 성공적으로 농축된 원소 에센스를 수집할 수 있었다","source_cn":"经历了费时的寻找，你们成功收集到了浓郁的元素精华。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3105C1B6B99C96E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1064008002:0":{"text":"그리고 다시 광산에 돌아왔을 때, 조아가 회색 거품이 부글부글 끓는 큰 솥 앞에서 우리를 기다리고 있었다","source_cn":"随后，你们返回了矿洞里，祖娅已经在此等候。而她的面前正...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064008003:1":{"text":"마침 잘 왔어!","source_cn":"你们回来的正好！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x88D9A03E29CF4F06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064008004:1":{"text":"애쉬 머쉬룸 수프 한 그릇 할래?","source_cn":"快来尝尝晶化伞菇浓汤！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x642F324E80BCC747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:4::2":{"text":"애쉬 머쉬룸 수프","source_cn":"晶化伞菇浓汤","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47B130493054B7F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1064008004":{"text":"애쉬 머쉬룸 수프 한 그릇 할래?","source_cn":"快来尝尝晶化伞菇浓汤！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x642F324E80BCC747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064008005:1":{"text":"당연하지! 재료는 애쉬 크리스탈, 통통 버섯 정령 머리 위의 작은 버섯갓, 그리고 밀가루와 양젖이야.","source_cn":"肯定能啊！原料是暗烬晶体、蹦蹦菇灵头上的小伞菌、面粉和羊奶。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xCCC9867F3C4BD0B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064008006:1":{"text":"정상적인 재료잖아! 다 먹을 수 있는 것들이라고!","source_cn":"多正常啊！都是能吃的东西！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x99198ECA458F3202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064008007:1":{"text":"밀가루와 양젖 말고는 그다지 정상적인 재료들은 아닌 것 같은데...","source_cn":"面粉和羊奶以外的另两个也算普通吗……？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5D45B6C4CF56CBC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064008008:1":{"text":"먹을 수 있다는 기준이... 너무 낮은 거 아니야?","source_cn":"判断标准竟然是能不能吃吗……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5954F047B5E17A62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064008009:1":{"text":"나도 그렇게 생각하네. 버섯 종류는 먹을 때 특히 조심해야 하지.","source_cn":"老夫也这么觉得，菌菇类食用起来需要格外小心。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x2F3E1F1F7099B3F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064008010:0":{"text":"이 버섯... 색깔이 자연스럽지 않군.","source_cn":"这个菌伞的颜色看起来……不太妙啊。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB2F4DA770F35EF90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064008011:0":{"text":"들켰네... 원래 레시피에는 솜털 버섯이 들어갔는데, 갑자기 영감이 떠올라서...","source_cn":"竟然被发现了……食谱上写的是茸茸伞菇，但我灵机一动——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBB1922501ED51166","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064008012:0":{"text":"통통 버섯 정령 머리 위의 작은 버섯갓으로 바꿨어. 어, 어차피 같은 버섯이니까 비슷할 거 아냐...","source_cn":"换成了蹦蹦菇灵头上的小伞菌。反正、反正都是蘑菇，差不多...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1064008012":{"text":"통통 버섯 정령 머리 위의 작은 버섯갓으로 바꿨어. 어, 어차피 같은 버섯이니까 비슷할 거 아냐...","source_cn":"换成了蹦蹦菇灵头上的小伞菌。反正、反正都是蘑菇，差不多的吧……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3BFF5848CC191C56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064008013:1":{"text":"아니, 아니! 모험을 해야 놀라움이 있는 법이라니까.","source_cn":"不不不，都说了冒险才有惊喜。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xA602E816A3DDFACD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064008014:0":{"text":"통통 버섯 정령은 버섯 마물인가?","source_cn":"蹦蹦菇灵是蘑菇怪吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x11FC265A2F886DD4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064008015:1":{"text":"이름만 들으면 걷는 버섯 같긴 한데.","source_cn":"听起来有点像行走菇呢。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x69C98F1FE782CE92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064008016:1":{"text":"아닌 것 같아...","source_cn":"我不这么觉得……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x91058339E850AF75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064008017:1":{"text":"조아, 한 그릇만 줘.","source_cn":"祖娅，请给我盛一碗。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x313FE032FDB5274D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064008018:1":{"text":"난 네 생각에 전적으로 동의해. 모험 정신은 절대 빠질 수 없지!","source_cn":"我非常认同你的观点，冒险精神是必不可少的东西！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x10F7176D509DF699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064008019:1":{"text":"그, 그렇게까지 진지하게 말할 건...","source_cn":"倒、倒也不必这么坚定……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x56D5D195CB872178","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064008020:1":{"text":"그래도 좋게 봐줘서 고마워...","source_cn":"但、但还是谢谢你赏脸……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE4F7F2F644EFD8F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064008021:1":{"text":"라이오스는 우리의 걱정에도 불구하고, 조아가 건네는 그릇을 받아 단숨에 절반을 들이켰다.","source_cn":"莱欧斯不顾你们的质疑，接过祖娅递来的碗，一口气喝下了大...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064008022:1":{"text":"그리고 우리는 옆에서 숨을 죽이고 그의 반응을 지켜봤다.","source_cn":"你们在一旁屏住呼吸，紧张地观察着他的反应。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD81DC5ECE764E33F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064008023:0":{"text":"음... 독특한 광물 맛이 나. 질감도 꽤 부드러워.","source_cn":"唔……有种奇特的矿物质味道，质地很顺滑。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCF7FC2B3EE3D6144","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064008024:0":{"text":"거기에 버섯 향이 더해져서... 마치 통통 버섯 정령이 내 앞에서 춤추는 것 같네...","source_cn":"又有菌菇的香气，好像能看到蹦蹦菇灵在我面前跳动……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x611D9A61DE9FB423","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1064008025:1":{"text":"...잠깐, 통통 버섯 정령이 보인다는 건 별로 안 좋은 징조 같은데?","source_cn":"喂！你该不会产生幻觉了吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x47C8952B45CC6962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064008026:0":{"text":"라이오스, 괜찮아?","source_cn":"莱欧斯？你没事吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x89518F329482AA61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064008027:1":{"text":"시, 실례할게! 통통 버섯 정령이 나를 데리고... 우웩!","source_cn":"啊，蹦蹦菇灵说要往那边去——呕呕呕呕呕……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7404315DD9D8BAB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064008028:0":{"text":"라이오스가 비틀거리며 멀리 달려가더니, 광산 기둥을 붙잡고 토하기 시작했다.","source_cn":"莱欧斯跌跌撞撞地跑向了远处，扶着矿柱狂吐了起来。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1D5577FF2850DED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064008029:0":{"text":"광산 안에서 울려 퍼지는 그 소리 때문에 분위기는 더욱 어색해졌다...","source_cn":"回声在矿洞中反复回荡，场面更尴尬了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCB860B98136E5CEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064008030:1":{"text":"윽... 아무래도 실험 실패인 것 같은데...","source_cn":"呃……看来，实验失败了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF133BB8626273C4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064008031:1":{"text":"미안! 내가 너무 성급했어. 내가 먼저 먹어봤어야 했는데!","source_cn":"对不起！我太草率了！我应该先自己品尝的！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x39E2965233992003","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064008032:1":{"text":"조아, 안 먹어본 거였어요?!","source_cn":"祖娅，你自己竟然都没尝过！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9C01D9C96DEC1017","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064008033:1":{"text":"내가 너무 들떴었나봐... 사과의 의미로 용광로 칠면조 롤을 대접할게!","source_cn":"我得意忘形了……作为赔罪，我请大家吃这个锻炉火鸡卷！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x156927987A93413E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:52::2":{"text":"용광로 칠면조 롤","source_cn":"锻炉火鸡卷","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x918767B17DA9C193","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064008034:1":{"text":"그건 네가 만든 거 아니지?","source_cn":"这不会也是你做的吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC64ADCD840A194A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064008035:0":{"text":"걱정 마. 우리 마을의 그웨나 아주머니가 만든 거라서 완전 안전해!","source_cn":"放心，这是村里葛文娜大娘做的，安全无毒！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x69F06E695A0CA4E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064008036:1":{"text":"...내가 먼저 먹어볼게!","source_cn":"……我先吃一口！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x27E183B89150B922","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064008037:1":{"text":"응! 완전 문제없어!","source_cn":"瞧！完全没问题！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC40BA11154AA0116","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064008038:1":{"text":"우리는 라이오스의 토하는 소리를 배경음 삼아, 복잡한 표정을 지으며 용광로 칠면조 롤을 나눠 먹었다.","source_cn":"你们在莱欧斯的呕吐伴奏声中，面色复杂地分食了锻炉火鸡卷。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC07C256906E94491","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1064008039:0":{"text":"맛은 나쁘지 않았다. 다만 그 배경음 때문에 입맛이 뚝 떨어졌을 뿐.","source_cn":"味道确实不错，只是背景音乐让人胃口大减。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x46509D9E63E8A11E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064008040:1":{"text":"의외로, 라이오스는 금방 돌아왔다...","source_cn":"令人意外的是，莱欧斯很快回来了……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3DA89EF0B4932C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064008041:1":{"text":"나 괜찮아! 방금 전에는 조금 힘들었는데, 이젠 기분 최고야!","source_cn":"我没事了！虽然刚才有点不舒服，但现在感觉特别好！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC1F137421D17B1DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1064008042:1":{"text":"얼른 어둠 소환 스튜를 만들자. 더는 못 기다리겠어!","source_cn":"我们快去做最后的黑暗召唤锅吧，我已经等不及了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x655C9092C6B2813B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064008043:1":{"text":"정말? 안 쉬어도 되겠어?","source_cn":"你确定吗？要不要再休息一下？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF8DBF9369912E1FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_ind